    "chunk_text": "be Wilfer\u00fees worde & Wulfhere cyning brohte Wihtwarum fulwiht \u00e6rest. Her sunne a\u00feiestrode, & Arcenbryht Cantwara cyng for\u00feferde; & Colman mid his geferum for to his \u00dey ilcan geare w\u00e6s micel mancuealm; & Ceadda & Wilfer\u00fe w\u00e6ron gehadode, & \u00fey ilcan geare Her \u00feeodorus mon hadode to ercebiscep: Her Ecgbryht cyning salde Basse m\u00e6sseprioste Reculf mynster on to timbranne. Her for\u00feferde Osweo Nor\u00feanhymbra cyning, & Ecgfer\u00fe ricsode \u00e6fter him; & Hlo\u00fehere feng to Her w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t micle fugla w\u00e6l. Her for\u00feferde Cenwalh & Seaxburg an gear ricsode his cuen \u00e6fter him. Her Ecgbryht Cantwara cyning for\u00feferde; & \u00fey geare w\u00e6s seno\u00f0 \u00e6t Heorotforda, & Sancte Her feng \u00e6scwine to rice on Wesseaxum, se wes Cenfusing, Cenfus Cenfer\u00feing, Cenfer\u00fe Her Wulfhere Pending & \u00e6scwine gefuhton \u00e6t Biedanheafde; & \u00fey ilcan geare Wulfhere for\u00feferde, Her \u00e6scwine for\u00feferde, & Hedde feng to biscepdome, & Centwine feng to rice; & Centwine was Her o\u00feiewde cometa se steorra. & Wilfri\u00fe biscop w\u00e6s adrifen of his biscopdome from Ecgfer\u00fee cyninge. Her \u00e6lfwine w\u00e6s ofsl\u00e6gen, & Sancte \u00e6\u00feel\u00fery\u00fe for\u00feferde. Her ges\u00e6t \u00feeodorius \u00e6rcebiscop seno\u00fe on H\u00e6\u00fefelda, for\u00feon he wolde \u00feone Cristes geleafan On \u00feissum geare Cent",
